%% TECH-013 Birthday card hierarchy and small phones
%% How the closed card with one kid and the arrows adapt to the phone's size.
flowchart TD
    A[Closed card with one kid] --> B[Date as a text-xl label, name text-3xl - R1]
    A --> C[Picture box takes the height left, 72-192 px, size = its shortest side, so round - R3 R4]
    A --> D{Narrower than 23rem?}
    D -- yes --> E[Chip text-sm on one line - R2; arrows at the deck's edge - R5]
    D -- no --> F[Chip and arrows as before - R7]
    A --> G{600 px high or lower?}
    G -- yes --> H[Less padding and gaps, Storlekar clear of Önskelista - R3]
    G -- no --> I[Spacing as before - R7]
    J[FitName] -->|its box or the screen changes size| K[Fit again: grows back if it fits - R6]
